---
/** 10. Split section: a large paragraph and the accent button, next to a rounded picture that scales up as it scrolls in. */
import Ridgelines from "../Ridgelines.astro";
import { ROUTES } from "../../lib/urls";
---

<section class="split" aria-label="年度首选推荐光速云">
  <div class="container-x split-col">
    <div class="split-pic">
      <div class="split-frame">
        <Ridgelines />
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="t-big split-text">
      在 42 家收录机场中，我们将综合排名第 1 的「光速云 (Guangsu Cloud)」列为年度主力首选：采用 IEPL 内网专线 + 企业内网双专线架构与 VLESS 协议，覆盖美、日、韩、港、新、台、英等 20+ 国家/地区共 58 条主力节点，同时提供 ¥99/年轻量年付、¥15/月标准月付及 ¥147/260G 永久不限时流量包（注册即领 8 折券 gsu8888），并附 2026-08-11 真实测速长图佐证。
    </p>
    <div class="split-btn flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href={ROUTES.brandDetail("guangsuyun")} class="btn btn-primary">查看光速云深度评测</a>
      <a href={ROUTES.brands} class="btn btn-secondary">对比全部 42 家机场</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    padding-block: 48px;
  }
  .split-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .split-pic {
    width: 100%;
    height: 49.87vw;
  }
  .split-frame {
    height: 100%;
    overflow: clip;
    border-radius: var(--radius-media);
    background: var(--c-surface);
  }
  .split-frame :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .split-text {
    width: 90%;
    margin: 24px 0 0 5%;
    font-size: min(4.948827vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .split-btn {
    margin: 25px 0 0 5%;
  }
  /* Desktop: picture on the right half (588 × 780 at 1440), text and button in the left half. */
  @media (min-width: 1001px) {
    .split {
      padding-block: 96px 240px;
    }
    .split-col {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 780px;
      padding-top: 64px;
    }
    .split-pic {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      width: 49%;
      height: 780px;
    }
    .split-text {
      width: 47%;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 1.42;
    }
    .split-btn {
      margin: 32px 0 0;
    }
  }
</style>
